  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 10 ranks, Study sphere.</p>\n<p>You can spend 3 uses of skill leverage and 1 hour in deep contemplation, searching your mind for the answer to a specific question of your choice. Due to the esoteric nature of this ability, the answer to the question is usually as simple as a short phrase, or be more cryptic in origin.</p>\n<p>You have a 70% chance + 1% per rank in the associated skill you possess of gaining a true answer.</p>\n<p>If the roll fails, you gain no information from this ability, while a roll of 91% or higher produces a misunderstanding. If you use this ability to ask the same question, you receive the same answer as you did previously, unless you have leveled up since you asked the question, which allows a new roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/study#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
